# The public half of the key that signs Tiamot releases.
#
# **This is a trust root.** A build compiles it in and will apply an update
# only if the manifest is signed by this key, or by a successor whose hash a
# manifest signed by this key already committed to (docs/distribution.md §2).
#
# It lives in the repository rather than in a CI variable on purpose: a
# variable can be changed by anyone with settings access and leaves no trace,
# while a change to this file is a diff in the history that a person can see.
# Changing it means every installed build stops accepting updates until it is
# replaced by hand, so it changes when a key is lost and at no other time.
#
# The private half is on the maintainer's machine and never in this repository,
# in CI, or in any log.
16b76ab8cddd949fa38a4906a735e47383534be3cd4e22409d86f72894849fb7
